                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "e7d60890-8885-3abc-8b53-83c239c44b55",
                        "entry_id": "800a6dd9-a38b-37b8-92a9-7a22fcedb3e1",
                        "glosses": [
                            "bread roll, bun"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "c1601d65-e385-45ed-b5a3-06eabf4311b7",
                                "sense_id": "e7d60890-8885-3abc-8b53-83c239c44b55",
                                "text": "Всё э́то случи́лось в одно́ вре́мя: ма́льчик подбежа́л к го́лубю и, улыба́ясь, взгляну́л на Лё́вина; го́лубь затреща́л кры́льями и отпорхну́л, блестя́ на со́лнце ме́жду дрожа́щими в во́здухе пыли́нками сне́га, а из око́шка пахну́ло ду́хом печё́ного хле́ба и вы́ставились са́йки.",
                                "translation": "It all happened at the same time: a boy ran towards a dove and glanced smiling at Levin; the dove, with a whir of her wings, darted away, flashing in the sun, amid grains of snow that quivered in the air, while from a little window there came a smell of fresh-baked bread, and the loaves were put out.",
                                "english": "It all happened at the same time: a boy ran towards a dove and glanced smiling at Levin; the dove, with a whir of her wings, darted away, flashing in the sun, amid grains of snow that quivered in the air, while from a little window there came a smell of fresh-baked bread, and the loaves were put out."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "a93ef8b1-224e-4130-bdc8-7825ee7cf97b",
                                "sense_id": "e7d60890-8885-3abc-8b53-83c239c44b55",
                                "text": "— Врёшь, мерза́вец! Ра́зве са́йки с изю́мом быва́ют? Пошё́л вон!",
                                "translation": "Vladimir Gilyarovsky",
                                "english": "Vladimir Gilyarovsky"
                            }
                        ]
                    },
